      },
      "message": "docs(mcp): camcraft-mcp skill rows for the 20 tools without one\n\nThe skill table lacked a row for 20 registered MCP tools, edit_machine\n(#1162, PR #1223) among them. Each row was checked against its\ncrates/app/src/mcp/ registration and schema: names, required and\noptional parameters, refusal behaviour and undo. Added under the\nsection each tool belongs to, and detect_pockets under section 5.\n\nProcess file: .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md and\n.claude/PROCESS_VERSION (41 -> 42; the number is taken at merge time).\n\nFixes #1318\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
